#: .strings.FAITHFUL_TARGETING_MATRIX_NAME
msgctxt ".strings.FAITHFUL_TARGETING_MATRIX_NAME"
msgid "Targeting Matrix"
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_TARGETING_MATRIX_PICKUP
msgid ""
"Target a random enemy on kill. Damage dealt to the target will 'Critically "
"Strike'. Killing the target increases your 'Critical Strike' damage."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_TARGETING_MATRIX_PICKUP_QUALITY
msgid ""
"Target <sprite name=\"Quality\"> random enemies on kill. Damage dealt to "
"targets will 'Critically Strike'. Killing targets increases your 'Critical "
"Strike' damage.\n"
"<sprite name=\"Quality\"> Damaging targets also damages surrounding enemies."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_TARGETING_MATRIX_DESC
msgid ""
"<style=cIsDamage>Target</style> a random enemy on kill. Damage dealt to the "
"<style=cIsDamage>target</style> has a <style=cIsDamage>+100%</style> chance "
"to '<style=cIsDamage>Critically Strike</style>' and killing the "
"<style=cIsDamage>target</style> increases <style=cIsDamage>Critical Strike</"
"style> damage by <style=cIsDamage>+[CRIT_DAMAGE]%</style> "
"<style=cStack>(+[CRIT_DAMAGE_STACKING]% per stack)</style>, up to "
"<style=cIsUtility>[MAX_BUFFS]</style> <style=cStack>(+[MAX_BUFFS_STACKING] "
"per stack)</style> <style=cIsUtility>times</style>."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_TARGETING_MATRIX_DESC_QUALITY
msgid ""
"<style=cIsDamage>Target</style> <sprite name=\"Quality\"> "
"<style=cIsDamage>[TARGETS]</style> random enemies on kill, up to <sprite "
"name=\"Quality\"> <style=cIsUtility>[TARGETS]</style> "
"<style=cStack>(+[TARGETS_STACKING] per stack)</style>. Damage dealt to "
"<style=cIsDamage>targets</style> has a <style=cIsDamage>+100%</style> chance "
"to '<style=cIsDamage>Critically Strike</style>' and killing "
"<style=cIsDamage>targets</style> increases <style=cIsDamage>Critical Strike</"
"style> damage by <style=cIsDamage>+[CRIT_DAMAGE]%</style> "
"<style=cStack>(+[CRIT_DAMAGE_STACKING]% per stack)</style>, up to "
"<style=cIsUtility>[MAX_BUFFS]</style> <style=cStack>(+[MAX_BUFFS_STACKING] "
"per stack)</style> <style=cIsUtility>times</style>.\n"
"Hitting <style=cIsDamage>targets</style> also damages enemies within <sprite "
"name=\"Quality\"> <style=cIsUtility>[RADIUS]m</style> for <sprite name="
"\"Quality\"> <style=cIsDamage>[DAMAGE]%</style> "
"<style=cStack>(+[DAMAGE_STACKING]% per stack)</style> TOTAL damage."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_TARGETING_MATRIX_LORE
msgid ""
"Order: Prototype Targeting System\n"
"Tracking Number: 1981******\n"
"Estimated Delivery: 03/31/2057\n"
"Shipping Method: Priority\n"
"Shipping Address: Royal Drive, Bubble Station, Mars\n"
"Shipping Details:\n"
"\n"
"Here's that new snazzy little gizmo we've been working on for a while. I "
"thought you might like to have a look at it in person so I went ahead and "
"sent you one of the prototypes.\n"
"\n"
"NOTE: Do NOT follow its targeting recommendations. The software is still "
"unreliable and seems to often select targets at random. Or at least it "
"appears to be random. It has a habit of targeting non-combatants which is... "
"a little worrying but I’m sure we'll have that fixed soon.\n"
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_TARGETING_MATRIX_BUFF
msgctxt ".strings.FAITHFUL_TARGETING_MATRIX_BUFF"
msgid "Targeting Matrix"
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_BRASS_SCREWS_NAME
msgctxt ".strings.FAITHFUL_BRASS_SCREWS_NAME"
msgid "Brass Screws"
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_BRASS_SCREWS_PICKUP
msgid "Increase damage while within the Teleporter zone."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_BRASS_SCREWS_PICKUP_QUALITY
msgid ""
"[PREFIX] <sprite name=\"Quality\"> Killing an enemy while within the "
"Teleporter zone gives you a temporary damage boost."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_BRASS_SCREWS_DESC
msgid ""
"Increase damage by <style=cIsDamage>[DAMAGE]%</style> "
"<style=cStack>(+[DAMAGE_STACKING]% per stack)</style> while inside the "
"Teleporter zone."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_BRASS_SCREWS_DESC_QUALITY
msgid ""
"[PREFIX] Each enemy killed while inside the Teleporter zone increases damage "
"by <sprite name=\"Quality\"> <style=cIsDamage>[DAMAGE]%</style> for <sprite "
"name=\"Quality\"> <style=cIsDamage>[DURATION]</style> "
"<style=cStack>(+[DURATION_STACKING] per stack)</style> seconds."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_BRASS_SCREWS_LORE
msgid ""
"<style=cMono>\r//--AUTO-TRANSCRIPTION FROM UES [Redacted] --//</style>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"\"Yo, how’re you holding up- woah!\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Oh, u-uh... Hey, there. I’ve been... a little busy as you can see.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"I never thought I'd see so many dead beetles and... a queen? Did you kill "
"an entire nest? By yourself?! How’d you-?! Gah!\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Heheh... yeah. It was real bloody.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"H-how’d you even manage all this? Are... are those screws?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"These? Yeah, your whole 'gear' talk gave me an idea.\""
msgstr ""

