msgid "Brass Screws"
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_BRASS_SCREWS_QUALITY_BUFF
msgid "Brass Kill"
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_VENGEFUL_TOASTER_NAME
msgid "Vengeful Toaster"
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_VENGEFUL_TOASTER_PICKUP
msgid "Taking damage temporarily increases your own."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_VENGEFUL_TOASTER_PICKUP_QUALITY
msgid ""
"[PREFIX]\n"
"<sprite name=\"Quality\"> Nearby allies taking damage also temporarily "
"increases damage. Chance to further increase damage at lower health."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_VENGEFUL_TOASTER_DESC
msgid ""
"Getting hit grants <style=cIsDamage>Vengeance</style> for "
"<style=cIsUtility>[DURATION]</style> <style=cStack>(+[DURATION_STACKING] per "
"stack)</style> seconds. Each stack of <style=cIsDamage>Vengeance</style> "
"increases damage by <style=cIsDamage>+[DAMAGE]%</style>. All stacks of "
"<style=cIsDamage>Vengeance</style> are consumed upon dealing damage."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_VENGEFUL_TOASTER_DESC_QUALITY
msgid ""
"[PREFIX]\n"
"Gain <style=cIsDamage>Vengeance</style> for every ally that takes damage "
"within <sprite name=\"Quality\"> <style=cIsUtility>[RADIUS]m</style>. For "
"every <style=cIsHealth>1% health missing</style>, gain a <sprite name="
"\"Quality\"> <style=cIsDamage>[CHANCE]%</style> "
"<style=cStack>(+[CHANCE_STACKING]% per stack)</style> chance to gain "
"<style=cIsDamage>1</style> extra stack of <style=cIsDamage>Vengeance</"
"style>. Every interval of <style=cIsDamage>100%</style> chance "
"<style=cIsUtility>guarantees</style> another <style=cIsDamage>Vengeance</"
"style> stack."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_VENGEFUL_TOASTER_LORE
msgid ""
"<style=cMono>\r//--AUTO-TRANSCRIPTION FROM UES [Redacted] --//</style>\n"
"<style=cMono>\r\n"
"//--DISMISSAL REPORT --//</style>\n"
"\n"
"\"Boss! Boss! I've created a kitchen appliance that can feel pain!\"\n"
"\n"
"\"...Why didn’t we fire you after that buzzsaw drone incident...?\""
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_HERMITS_SHAWL_NAME
msgid "Hermit's Shawl"
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_HERMITS_SHAWL_PICKUP
msgid "Deal more damage the longer you've been out of combat."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_HERMITS_SHAWL_PICKUP_QUALITY
msgid ""
"[PREFIX]\n"
"<sprite name=\"Quality\"> Chance to block incoming damage out of combat. "
"Blocking damage heals you."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_HERMITS_SHAWL_DESC
msgid ""
"Leaving combat grants <style=cIsDamage>Patience</style>, increasing damage "
"by <style=cIsDamage>+[DAMAGE]%</style>. You can have up to "
"<style=cIsDamage>[MAX_BUFFS]</style> <style=cStack>(+[MAX_BUFFS_STACKING] "
"per stack)</style> stacks that are all gained over "
"<style=cIsUtility>[BUFF_RECHARGE]</style> seconds. All stacks of "
"<style=cIsDamage>Patience</style> are consumed upon dealing damage."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_HERMITS_SHAWL_DESC_QUALITY
msgid ""
"[PREFIX]\n"
"<sprite name=\"Quality\"> <style=cIsHealing>[BLOCK_CHANCE]%</style> "
"<style=cStack>(+[BLOCK_CHANCE_STACKING]% per stack)</style> chance to "
"<style=cIsHealing>block</style> incoming damage at the cost of <sprite name="
"\"Quality\"> <style=cIsDamage>[BLOCK_COST]</style> stacks of "
"<style=cIsDamage>Patience</style>. <style=cIsUtility>Unaffected by luck</"
"style>. <style=cIsHealing>Blocking</style> damage <style=cIsHealing>heals</"
"style> you for <sprite name=\"Quality\"> <style=cIsHealing>[HEAL]</style> "
"<style=cStack>(+[HEAL_STACKING] per stack)</style> "
"<style=cIsHealing>health</style>."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_HERMITS_SHAWL_LORE
msgid ""
"\"...And as the great hermit stepped down from her mountainside abode,\n"
"seeing the crowd of pilgrims that had come to be in her presence,\n"
"she gracefully said,\n"
"\n"
"'STEP THE HELL OFF MY GARDEN!'\n"
"\n"
"Maybe modern humans should not be deified, but just the values they hold.\"\n"
"\n"
"- Records of Future Faith 2052\n"
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_MELTING_WARBLER_NAME
msgctxt ".strings.FAITHFUL_MELTING_WARBLER_NAME"
msgid "Melting Warbler"
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_MELTING_WARBLER_PICKUP
msgid "Increase jump height."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_MELTING_WARBLER_PICKUP_QUALITY
msgid ""
"[PREFIX] <sprite name=\"Quality\"> Increase movement speed while airborne."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_MELTING_WARBLER_DESC
msgid ""
"Increase <style=cIsUtility>jump height</style> by "
"<style=cIsUtility>[JUMP_BOOST]m</style> <style=cStack>(+[JUMP_BOOST_STACKING]"
"m per stack)</style>."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_MELTING_WARBLER_DESC_QUALITY
msgid ""
"[PREFIX] Increase <style=cIsUtility>movement speed</style> by <sprite name="
"\"Quality\"> <style=cIsUtility>[SPEED]%</style> (+[SPEED_STACKING]% per "
"stack) while airborne."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_MELTING_WARBLER_LORE
msgid ""
"Order: Wax Warbler\n"
"Tracking Number: 27*******\n"
"Estimated Delivery: 02/15/2057\n"
"Shipping Method: Priority\n"
"Shipping Address: Research Center, Polarity Zone, Neptune\n"
"Shipping Details:\n"
"\n"
"Hello Buu,\n"
"This is Mama again, how is everything where you are?\n"
"\n"
"We’ve had the heat on a bit higher for the colder months which led to some "
"of Papa's wax models melting so we’ve had to move them out of the house for "
"now. I am sending one to you that we thought you might like. There were a "
"few more that he wanted you to have but Papa is moving onto using wood now "
"so look forward to next time.\n"
"\n"
"Hope we can meet Buu again soon! :-)\n"
"Mama"
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_MELTING_WARBLER_QUALITY_BUFF
msgctxt ".strings.FAITHFUL_MELTING_WARBLER_QUALITY_BUFF"
msgid "Melting Warbler"
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_LEADERS_PENNON_NAME
msgctxt ".strings.FAITHFUL_LEADERS_PENNON_NAME"
msgid "Leader's Pennon"
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_LEADERS_PENNON_PICKUP
msgid ""
"Carry a flag that creates a ward around yourself. Grants other nearby allies "
"attack speed and regeneration."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_LEADERS_PENNON_PICKUP_QUALITY
msgid ""
"Carry a flag that creates a ward around yourself. Grants <sprite name="
"\"Quality\"> nearby allies attack speed and regeneration.\n"
"<sprite name=\"Quality\"> Activating interactables grants nearby allies "
"temporary movement speed."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_LEADERS_PENNON_DESC
msgid ""
"Create a ward around yourself that strengthens all allies other than "
"yourself within <style=cIsUtility>[RADIUS]m</style> "
"<style=cStack>(+[RADIUS_STACKING]m per stack)</style>. Raise "
"<style=cIsDamage>attack speed</style> by <style=cIsDamage>[ATTACK_SPEED]%</"
"style> <style=cStack>(+[ATTACK_SPEED_STACKING]% per stack)</style> and "
"<style=cIsHealing>passive health regeneration</style> by "
"<style=cIsHealing>+[REGEN]hp/s</style> <style=cStack>(+[REGEN_STACKING]hp/s "
"per stack)</style>."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_LEADERS_PENNON_DESC_QUALITY
msgid ""
"Create a ward around yourself that strengthens all allies within "
"<style=cIsUtility>[RADIUS]m</style> <style=cStack>(+[RADIUS_STACKING]m per "
"stack)</style>. Raise <style=cIsDamage>attack speed</style> by "
"<style=cIsDamage>[ATTACK_SPEED]%</style> "
"<style=cStack>(+[ATTACK_SPEED_STACKING]% per stack)</style> and "
"<style=cIsHealing>passive health regeneration</style> by "
"<style=cIsHealing>+[REGEN]hp/s</style> <style=cStack>(+[REGEN_STACKING]hp/s "
"per stack)</style>. Activating an interactable increases nearby ally "
"<style=cIsUtility>movement speed</style> by <sprite name=\"Quality\"> "
"<style=cIsUtility>[SPEED]%</style> for <sprite name=\"Quality\"> "
"<style=cIsUtility>[DURATION]</style> <style=cStack>(+[DURATION_STACKING] per "
"stack)</style> seconds."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_LEADERS_PENNON_LORE
msgid ""
"We knew we'd never win. This planet was as hellish as it was relentless.\n"
"\n"
"Many died as soon as the blast doors opened. Lizard people, giant jellyfish, "
"constructs made of the very ground beneath our very feet. They all conspired "
"somehow - someway - to massacre us all. We never stood a chance.\n"
"\n"
"And our squad leader, that damn idiot... What was left of him was marked "
"with the flag that led us to our demise."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_LEADERS_PENNON_BUFF
msgctxt ".strings.FAITHFUL_LEADERS_PENNON_BUFF"
msgid "Leader's Pennon"
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_LEADERS_PENNON_SPEED_BUFF
msgid "Leader's Pennon Speed"
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_SECOND_HAND_NAME
msgctxt ".strings.FAITHFUL_SECOND_HAND_NAME"
msgid "Second Hand"
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_SECOND_HAND_PICKUP
msgid "Increase attack speed and movement speed while grounded."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_SECOND_HAND_PICKUP_QUALITY
msgid ""
"[PREFIX]\n"
"<sprite name=\"Quality\"> Increase attack speed after being grounded for a "
"short period."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_SECOND_HAND_DESC
msgid ""
"Increase <style=cIsDamage>attack speed</style> by "
"<style=cIsDamage>[ATTACK_SPEED]%</style> "
"<style=cStack>(+[ATTACK_SPEED_STACKING]% per stack)</style> and "
"<style=cIsUtility>movement speed</style> by <style=cIsUtility>[SPEED]%</"
"style> <style=cStack>(+[SPEED_STACKING]% per stack)</style> while touching "
"the ground."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_SECOND_HAND_DESC_QUALITY
msgid ""
"[PREFIX]\n"
"Increase <style=cIsDamage>attack speed</style> by <sprite name=\"Quality\"> "
"<style=cIsDamage>[BOOST_ATTACK_SPEED]%</style> "
"<style=cStack>(+[BOOST_ATTACK_SPEED_STACKING]% per stack)</style> after "
"being grounded for <style=cIsUtility>[BOOST_DELAY]</style> seconds. Leaving "
"the ground maintains the effect for <sprite name=\"Quality\"> "
"<style=cIsUtility>[GRACE_DURATION]</style> seconds."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_SECOND_HAND_LORE
msgid ""
"Order: Antique Clock Hand (Replica)\n"
"Tracking Number: 77**********\n"
"Estimated Delivery: 08/23/2057\n"
"Shipping Method: Standard/Fragile\n"
"Shipping Address: Antiques Workshop, Continuum St., Saturn\n"
"Shipping Details:\n"
"\n"
"Here's /another/ replacement part.\n"
"\n"
"At some point it clearly has to be a fault in the clockwork. I can't imagine "
"how a single hand has caused you so much trouble.\n"
"\n"
"If this continues, we're going to have to start charging you for these parts."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_SECOND_HAND_BUFF
msgctxt ".strings.FAITHFUL_SECOND_HAND_BUFF"
msgid "Second Hand"
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_SECOND_HAND_BOOST_BUFF
msgid "Second Hand Boost"
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_SPACIOUS_UMBRELLA_NAME
msgid "Spacious Umbrella"
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_SPACIOUS_UMBRELLA_PICKUP
msgid "Increase the size of the Teleporter zone."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_SPACIOUS_UMBRELLA_PICKUP_QUALITY
msgid ""
"[PREFIX]\n"
"<sprite name=\"Quality\"> Staying inside the Teleporter Zone temporarily "
"increases its size over time."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_SPACIOUS_UMBRELLA_DESC
msgid ""
"Increase the size of the Teleporter zone by <style=cIsUtility>[SIZE]%</"
"style> <style=cStack>(+[SIZE_STACKING]% per stack)</style>."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_SPACIOUS_UMBRELLA_DESC_QUALITY
msgid ""
"[PREFIX]\n"
"While inside the Teleporter zone, it temporarily increases in size by "
"<sprite name=\"Quality\"> <style=cIsUtility>[SIZE]m</style> "
"<style=cStack>(+[SIZE_STACKING]m per stack)</style> every "
"<style=cIsUtility>[INTERVAL]</style> seconds up to "
