#: .strings.FAITHFUL_DROWNED_VISAGE_LORE
msgid ""
"> Automated report 4241442054494d4520544f2046495348 is now available from "
"site record 412044524f574e454420564953414745.\n"
"> Please refer to record 412044524f574e454420564953414745 for additional "
"personnel details during your review.\n"
"> Report Type: Transcription\n"
"> - Source: 412044524f574e454420564953414745 (Personal Suit Recorder)\n"
"> Priority: High\n"
"> Report Content:\n"
"\n"
"-- Beginning of Excerpt Flagged for Review --\n"
"\n"
"Dave: \"You've heard the nonsense rumors of that giant monster around here, "
"right?\"\n"
"\n"
"Michael: \"O' course I have. I'd have to be sleeping deeper than Gary to "
"miss that.\"\n"
"\n"
"Dave: \"Hah! He's the one who saw it apparently. Said it was the scariest "
"thing he'd seen here.\"\n"
"\n"
"Michael: \"Ha! Can't be that bad, then. Maybe he just dreamed it up while "
"kipping on duty.\"\n"
"\n"
"Dave: \"Sounds like 'im. Looked like death when I told him we were planning "
"on fish today.\"\n"
"\n"
"Michael: \"Haha! Now you're just bullying the poor guy, Dave!\"\n"
"\n"
"Dave: \"For something apparently so terrifying, he sure had a hard time "
"describing it. Something about a lure and-\"\n"
"\n"
"Michael: \"Hold up, the line's pulling!\"\n"
"\n"
"Dave: \"Woah, you snagged somethin'?!\"\n"
"\n"
"[Fishing rod reeling]\n"
"\n"
"Michael: \"...Oh. It's just a small fry...\"\n"
"\n"
"Dave: \"Heh... I thought that was it for a moment. Honestly, thought my "
"heart stopped.\"\n"
"\n"
"Michael: \"Me, too. Wouldn't that've be a story, hu-\"\n"
"\n"
"[Metallic crunch]\n"
"\n"
"-- End of Recording --\n"
"\n"
"-- End of Excerpt Flagged for Review --\n"
"\n"
"> Please refer to report 5448455927524520414c4c2044454144 for full audio "
"excerpt."
