"stack of <style=cIsDamage>scrutinize</style> they have."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_APPRAISERS_EYE_LORE
msgid ""
"<style=cMono>\r//--AUTO-TRANSCRIPTION FROM UES [Redacted] --//</style>\n"
"\n"
"\"Tell me tha' crackle was just a blown relay.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Negative. Cargo Bay C's on manual lockdown. Somebody tripped the inventory "
"lasers, the floor scales, an'— somehow— the nursery heaters.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"The what?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Exactly.\"\n"
"\n"
"[Distant metallic clattering. A wet popping sound can be heard every few "
"seconds.]\n"
"\n"
"\"I'm not goin' back in there.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Oh, c'mon. Bob ain't gonna hurt anybody.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"He's in the cargo bay talkin' to pallets, Gary. And every time he picks up "
"somethin' that weird doohickey on his shoulder flashes, then one o' those "
"little purple eggs drops outta it like it's layin' invoices.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"They're not eggs.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"They blinked at me.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"...Right. Okay. They might be eggs.\"\n"
"\n"
"[Intercom feedback whines loudly.]\n"
"\n"
"\"Attention deckhands: whoever sealed Cargo Bay C, open it immediately. "
"We've got volatile freight in there and Bob [Redacted] refuses to answer his "
"comm.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Cap', with respect, I think Bob's gone rogue. He lined up thirty-two "
"signal flares by shade, weight, and what he called 'attitude.' Then that "
"doohickey of his scanned the shelf, and now he's got half a dozen eyeball "
"eggs starin' at the crate of nail guns.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Maybe it's breedin'.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Maybe don't say that.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Well, one thing's for certain- I ain't goin' in there no matter what.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Agreed, if that thing ever learns to talk, I'm quittin' before it starts "
"assignin' us values.\"<style=cMono>\r\n"
"\n"
"//--TRANSCRIPTION ENDS: LOCAL STORAGE CORRUPTED BY UNAUTHORIZED MANIFEST "
"REVISION --//</style>"
msgstr ""

