"<style=cIsHealing>base maximum health</style> that is "
"<style=cIsHealing>shield</style>."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_MATTER_ACCELERATOR_LORE
msgid ""
"\"Day 17 of making a homemade matter accelerator.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"There's some good and bad news on my progress so far.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"The good news is that I've finally got it working consistently enough to "
"start testing its specs. The bad news is that I'm going to need a better "
"camera in order to record any actual results. The one I have now is way too "
"blurry.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Oh, I also managed to trigger my neighbor's home security system. So I "
"should probably work on avoiding that.\""
msgstr ""

