#: .strings.FAITHFUL_SURVIVOR_TECHNICIAN_NAME
msgid "Technician"
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_SURVIVOR_TECHNICIAN_DESCRIPTION
msgid ""
"The Technician uses her gadgets and technology to assist her in dealing "
"powerful instances of electrifying damage.\n"
"\n"
"< ! > Even if Arc cannot reach an enemy, using it on a nearby drone or "
"turret can allow Technician to still assist in damage via Overclock.\n"
"\n"
"< ! > Using Powervolt while tethered to a strong foe using Arc can be "
"effective for dealing with fodder surrounding it.\n"
"\n"
"< ! > Charge Flow can be used as both an approach or to dodge attacks when "
"close enough to an enemy or mechanical ally.\n"
"\n"
"< ! > Deploying and directing Technician's Conduits to favorable locations "
"can be useful for whittling down approaching enemies or to use Charge Flow "
"for extra mobility."
msgstr ""

