"your items</style>. Attacks nearby enemies, electrocuting them for "
"<style=cIsDamage>200% damage per second</style>."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_SURVIVOR_TECHNICIAN_PASSIVE_OVERCLOCK_NAME
msgid "Overclock"
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_SURVIVOR_TECHNICIAN_PASSIVE_OVERCLOCK_DESCRIPTION
msgid ""
"Using <style=cIsDamage>Arc</style> on mechanical allies "
"<style=cIsUtility>overclocks</style> them, increasing "
"<style=cIsDamage>attack</style> and <style=cIsUtility>movement speed</style>."
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_SURVIVOR_TECHNICIAN_PASSIVE_REPAIR_NAME
msgid "Repair"
msgstr ""

#: .strings.FAITHFUL_SURVIVOR_TECHNICIAN_PASSIVE_REPAIR_DESCRIPTION
